{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To Late: The Last Room is a short but intense horror experience, where darkness isn\u2019t just a visual challenge \u2013 it\u2019s the source of fear itself. Armed only with a weak flashlight, you walk through long, oppressive corridors and uniquely themed rooms, each carefully designed with light and visual effects to enhance the atmosphere. Some doors won\u2019t open easily, and not every room provides answers. The experience is heavily driven by tension and sound design. As you progress, you might begin to realize a darker truth \u2014 that you may already be dead, and this is just what comes after. The average playtime is around 30 minutes, but the unsettling feeling may last much longer.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740180?t=1748597336","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740180/d958f49f06e47c9e9e8da8db3380d136ab5d2642/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748597336","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740180/4235bb9650604441fea0dd47b283982f718da50b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748597336","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740180/4235bb9650604441fea0dd47b283982f718da50b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748597336","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood is visible in some places. Scary, depressing sound effects or sequences of images."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To Late: The Last Room is a short but intense horror experience, where darkness isn\u2019t just a visual challenge \u2013 it\u2019s the source of fear itself. Armed only with a weak flashlight, you walk through long, oppressive corridors and uniquely themed rooms, each carefully designed with light and visu